00:48:39.160 --> 00:48:45.220
They're from Texas and they became famous by doing all of these elaborate trick shots.
他们来自德克萨斯州，通过表演各种复杂的特技投篮而走红。

1135
00:48:45.440 --> 00:48:45.720
Yes.
是的。

1136
00:48:45.960 --> 00:48:46.520
On YouTube.
在YouTube上。

1137
00:48:46.740 --> 00:48:48.120
