但没错，他们肯定会做这种事。

1140
00:48:54.020 --> 00:48:59.360
They would have thrown a watermelon off of a building onto a trampoline and tried to hit something with it.
他们会把西瓜从楼上扔到蹦床上，试图用它砸中什么东西。

1141
00:48:59.760 --> 00:49:07.080
And Dwight and Michael's reaction just 100% reminded me of these Dude Perfect videos that I've been watching with my son.
德怀特和迈克尔的反应百分之百让我想起了我跟我儿子一起看的那些“完美老兄”视频。

