Yeah.
没错。

1148
00:49:29.200 --> 00:49:31.780
For all things trick shots with office ladies and Dude Perfect.
为了《办公室》女士们和“完美老兄”的所有特技投篮挑战。

1149
00:49:32.160 --> 00:49:35.000
