I love it.
我喜欢这样。

1158
00:49:45.580 --> 00:49:49.540
Two things before we leave the whole watermelon off the roof moment, Jenna.
在结束整个西瓜从屋顶扔下去的话题之前，珍娜，有两件事要说。

1159
00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:50.500
Okay.
好的。

1160
00:49:50.680 --> 00:49:55.640
Number one, all of these shots up here, when they look out over to the trampoline,
第一，所有这些在高处的镜头，当他们看向蹦床那边时，

