And on the commentary, they talked about this little bit, and they said that Gene and Lee came up with the whole shun thing, and that Rain is who physicalized it.
在评论音轨里，他们谈到了这个小桥段，说吉恩和李想出了整个“禁言”的点子，而雷恩则是把它演出来的人。

